[{"id":"assistant-message-root-resp_024229f299c79237016a9ca38476a887d0ad5068f034036b22","seq":10660,"timestamp":"1788650425Z","kind":"textDelta","sessionId":"d3c58d6b-c6ec-4263-a2e0-bf7cdf00c415","content":"能力核对发现两个不是“缺测试”而是实现缺口，必须先修根因，否则真实浏览器矩阵无法成立：\n\n1. Relay 管理页面只有 Relay Owner 可用，但当前真实拓扑把浏览器都作为普通受邀设备；因此“已有可信设备创建 invitation”这条 UI 实际会 403。需要让桌面浏览器走真实 first-owner claim，随后由它创建并二次确认手机 invitation，同时以秘密内存通道把 Host registration access 交给 fixture。\n2. HCP queue `remove` 的 canonical draft 在 Gateway 被丢弃，Relay client 又在 ACK 后重查普通 queue，因此“take-back 只回到请求设备草稿”在 Relay UI 不可能工作。需要让 queue state ACK 携带操作结果并由 HCP client消费。\n\n这两项均直接对应既有 Stage 5 交付，不是扩展范围。先修接口返回契约并加测试，再扩展场景。","startedSeq":10452,"endedSeq":10660,"startedAt":"1788650425Z","endedAt":"1788650430Z","timing":{"sessionElapsedSeconds":11395,"revision":10660,"observedAt":"1788650430Z","activeTurnStartedAt":"1788639035Z","activeTurnLastActivityAt":"1788650430Z","paused":false,"reason":"active","stateSnapshot":{"elapsedSeconds":0,"activeTurnStartedAt":1788639035,"activeTurnLastActivityAt":1788650430,"revision":10660,"sawTurn":true,"pendingPermissionIds":[],"pendingElicitationIds":[],"userWaitStartedAt":null,"userWaitSeconds":0}},"raw":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_message_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"。"},"messageId":"resp_024229f299c79237016a9ca38476a887d0ad5068f034036b22","_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","launchedAgentExecutionId":null,"toolName":null,"toolOutput":null}}}},{"id":"activity-10664","seq":10664,"timestamp":"1788650433Z","kind":"activitySummary","startedSeq":10664,"endedSeq":10775,"startedAt":"1788650433Z","endedAt":"1788650691Z","raw":{"goldBandActivity":{"activityStartSeq":10664,"activityEndSeq":10775,"totalEventCount":16,"toolCallCount":10,"thoughtCount":6,"errorCount":0,"readFileCount":5,"writtenFileCount":0,"detailAvailable":true}}},{"id":"assistant-message-root-resp_0818c6963df08b0f016a9ca496042c87d086de6889350eede8","seq":10925,"timestamp":"1788650691Z","kind":"textDelta","sessionId":"d3c58d6b-c6ec-4263-a2e0-bf7cdf00c415","content":"为了让第一台浏览器成为真正的 Relay Owner，同时不让 fixture 伪造 Owner 身份，采用已有恢复边界：Relay 服务器终端可签发 Host registration access，但不能授予任何 Host 角色。随后：\n\n1. fixture 只生成 terminal owner bootstrap material 并启动 Host presence；\n2. desktop 通过真实 Owner UI claim；\n3. desktop 在真实 Relay management UI 创建 invitation、读取并核对 fingerprint、二次确认；\n4. phone 使用该 invitation 与独立一次性 Host pairing token，Host 仍只授予 Controller。\n\n先为 terminal Host access 增加最小管理 API 分支和负向测试；它不接触 Host pairing registry，也不产生 Host Admin。","startedSeq":10776,"endedSeq":10925,"startedAt":"1788650691Z","endedAt":"1788650693Z","timing":{"sessionElapsedSeconds":11658,"revision":10925,"observedAt":"1788650693Z","activeTurnStartedAt":"1788639035Z","activeTurnLastActivityAt":"1788650693Z","paused":false,"reason":"active","stateSnapshot":{"elapsedSeconds":0,"activeTurnStartedAt":1788639035,"activeTurnLastActivityAt":1788650693,"revision":10925,"sawTurn":true,"pendingPermissionIds":[],"pendingElicitationIds":[],"userWaitStartedAt":null,"userWaitSeconds":0}},"raw":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_message_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"。"},"messageId":"resp_0818c6963df08b0f016a9ca496042c87d086de6889350eede8","_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","launchedAgentExecutionId":null,"toolName":null,"toolOutput":null}}}},{"id":"activity-10926","seq":10926,"timestamp":"1788650693Z","kind":"activitySummary","startedSeq":10926,"endedSeq":11135,"startedAt":"1788650693Z","endedAt":"1788651098Z","raw":{"goldBandActivity":{"activityStartSeq":10926,"activityEndSeq":11135,"totalEventCount":28,"toolCallCount":22,"thoughtCount":6,"errorCount":0,"readFileCount":3,"writtenFileCount":3,"detailAvailable":true}}},{"id":"assistant-message-root-resp_01b5fdc1495b2724016a9ca645fec087d0af2510d1b35bdb93","seq":11204,"timestamp":"1788651098Z","kind":"textDelta","sessionId":"d3c58d6b-c6ec-4263-a2e0-bf7cdf00c415","content":"先完成 invitation ceremony 的可执行纵切面并验证，再触碰 queue/Permission，避免一次改动混合多个失败根因。当前会将两个秘密 IPC 明确拆为 Owner bootstrap