psedSeconds":15910,"revision":14476,"observedAt":"1788654945Z","activeTurnStartedAt":"1788654928Z","activeTurnLastActivityAt":"1788654945Z","paused":false,"reason":"active","stateSnapshot":{"elapsedSeconds":15893,"activeTurnStartedAt":1788654928,"activeTurnLastActivityAt":1788654945,"revision":14476,"sawTurn":true,"pendingPermissionIds":[],"pendingElicitationIds":[],"userWaitStartedAt":null,"userWaitSeconds":0}},"raw":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_message_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"。"},"messageId":"resp_0ffffe1de0d10487016a9cb554018487d08d5540496e4fb96b","_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","launchedAgentExecutionId":null,"toolName":null,"toolOutput":null}}}},{"id":"activity-14477","seq":14477,"timestamp":"1788654951Z","kind":"activitySummary","startedSeq":14477,"endedSeq":14507,"startedAt":"1788654951Z","endedAt":"1788654998Z","raw":{"goldBandActivity":{"activityStartSeq":14477,"activityEndSeq":14507,"totalEventCount":8,"toolCallCount":6,"thoughtCount":2,"errorCount":0,"readFileCount":3,"writtenFileCount":1,"detailAvailable":true}}},{"id":"assistant-message-root-resp_0da3a9cb8fc01479016a9cb58d5bb887d085ecf182473c1ff0","seq":15587,"timestamp":"1788654998Z","kind":"textDelta","sessionId":"d3c58d6b-c6ec-4263-a2e0-bf7cdf00c415","content":"{\"version\":\"0.1\",\"kind\":\"dynamic-node-completion\",\"status\":\"success\",\"summary\":\"已推进 Stage 5 真实拓扑并保留全部有效未提交改动：补完 Stage5TopologyFixture queue gate，加入确定性 queue/Permission/abort faux turns、canonical active Run/queue/acceptedSeq/order/kind/client probe 与 Relay payload-blindness probe；修正 active/reserved/paused Session 下并发 follow-up 使用 Host 接收顺序分配 acceptedSeq、仅 idle Run 启动校验 Session revision，并收紧共享 HostStore TCK；Web 为 prompt/queue/abort/Permission 增加结构化失败投影和 canonical 重查，并在 Relay 断开时撤销失效 HostClient，避免向关闭通道发送命令。Web 单测 40/40、Web build、Host Core/SQLite tests 与 fixture compile 已通过。真实双独立 browser context 测试已实际通过并发 prompt、唯一递增 acceptedSeq、canonical queue arrival order、reorder、stale queue CAS、steer 与 requester-scoped take-back；当前继续失败在既定 Permission replay 边界：pending Permission 仅作为 transient AgentEvent，durable snapshot 缺少恢复 Dialog 所需的权威 request 字段，导致第二设备或重连设备无法参与 Permission 竞争。尚未完成 competing Permission、abort、dedup/restart continuity、最终 Stage 5/Stage 0–4 全量门禁、受限 Compose/公网验证、文档证据和提交。已将完成内容、验证结果、失败根因、下一步和安全约束写入当前节点 attachments/handoff.md。\",\"next\":{\"type\":\"single\",\"node\":{\"id\":\"phase-5-complete-permission-replay-and-gates\",\"kind\":\"worker\",\"title\":\"完成 Stage 5 Permission 恢复、真实矩阵与门禁\",\"provider\":\"claude-acp\",\"profile\":\"pf-builtin-dev-test\",\"task\":\"继续当前主 workspace 中全部有效未提交 Stage 5 改动，不得重置、覆盖或丢弃，不得进入 Stage 6/7，不得修改 original-pi/gold-band。先读取 phase-5-finish-real-topology-and-gates/attempt-001/attachments/handoff.md，并审查当前 diff。优先修复当前真实拓扑确认的既定 BLOCKER：pending Permission 仅有 transient AgentEvent，durable Host snapshot/query 无法让第二设备或重连设备恢复决策 UI。保持 Host canonical Session 为唯一事实源，在现有 Tool preparation/Permission canonical 边界保留并投影 permissionId、revision、tool name、arguments、workspace identity、structured risk；不得由 UI 推断或建立第二事实源。扩展 TypeScript SessionSnapshot 与 Zustand restore，只恢复结构完整且状态为 pending 的 Permission，其他情况 fail closed；先加最小 Java/TypeScript 失败测试再修复并转绿。随后继续同一真实 Local Host+Relay+Noise+HCP+SQLite+faux Provider、两个独立 browser context 的 Playwright 矩阵，完成 competing Permission、competing abort、command retry/dedup、durable replay/background recovery、Relay restart和Host restart后的Session/transcript/queue连续性与无重复、revoke、direct↔Relay、Relay payload blindness、响应式、键盘、焦点、axe、forced-colors。不得用 Java/unit-only 证据冒充真实浏览器覆盖；若浏览器 WebSocket API 无法可靠施加真实接收背压，应诚实保留 Java/HCP bounded-buffer slow-consumer 证据并明确可执行边界，不得伪造 browser coverage。完成后运行 scripts/verify-stage5.ps1、完整 Stage 0–4 回归、generated/Buf/API baseline/module/naming/lock/Web/Playwright/Java 门禁。按既有授权在 Ubuntu 上只操作 JI 自有 ji-relay Compose project、容器、网络、volume、目录、端口和日志，验证 Compose config/build/up/health/version/status/down、只读容器、独立 metadata volume、127.0.0.1:18090 ingress、./ji与适用ji.ps1 relay命令，以及 https://ji.lilypad.com.cn HTTPS/WSS 和既定 Remote Host拓扑；不得修改或重启Caddy、不得执行全局Docker操作、不得影响其他业务、不得输出secret。同步 docs/java-rewrite 与当前节点attachments中的verification manifest、NDJSON日志、脱敏trace、浏览器/部署/failure证据；独立Relay安全评审继续标记FOLLOW_UP。执行secret/submodule/process/port/cleanup/git diff检查，排除runtime .gold-band。只有所有可执行Stage 5门禁转绿且无已知实现或测试失败后，才创建一个本地Conventional Commit，footer精确为 Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>；不push、不建PR。完成后路由到codex-acp、pf-builtin-accept独立Stage 5验收。\"}}}","startedSeq":14508,"endedSeq":15587,"startedAt":"1788654998Z","endedAt":"1788655017Z","timing":{"sessionElapsedSeconds":15982,"revision":15587,"observedAt":"1788655017Z","activeTurnStartedAt":"1788654928Z","activeTurnLastActivityAt":"1788655017Z","paused":false,"reason":"active","stateSnapshot":{"elapsedSeconds":15893,"activeTurnStartedAt":1788654928,"activeTurnLastActivityAt":1788655017,"revision":15587,"sawTurn":true,"pendingPermissionIds":[],"pendingElicitationIds":[],"userWaitStartedAt":null,"userWaitSeconds":0}},"raw":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_message_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"}"},"messageId":"resp_0da3a9cb8fc01479016a9cb58d5bb887d085ecf182473c1ff0","_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","launchedAgentExecutionId":null,"toolName":null,"toolOutput":null}},"runtimeControlOutputDisplay":{"artifactName":"dynamic-node-completion","kind":"dynamic-node-completion","jsonText":"{\"version\":\"0.1\",\"kind\":\"dynamic-node-completion\",\"status\":\"success\",\"summary\":\"已推进 Stage 5 真实拓扑并保留全部有效未提交改动：补完 Stage5TopologyFixture queue gate，加入确定性 queue/Permission/abort faux turns、canonical active Run/queue/acceptedSeq/order/kind/client probe 与 Relay payload-blindness probe；修正 active/reserved/paused Session 下并发 follow-up 使用 Host 接收顺序分配 acceptedSeq、仅 idle Run 启动校验 Session revision，并收紧共享 HostStore TCK；Web 为 prompt/queue/abort/Permission 增加结构化失败投影和 canonical 重查，并在 Relay 断开时撤销失效 HostClient，避免向关闭通道发送命令。Web 单测 40/40、Web build、Host Core/SQLite tests 与 fixture compile 已通过。真实双独立 browser context 测试已实际通过并发 prompt、唯一递增 acceptedSeq、canonical queue a